nodes.body:
@Mike001-wq Thanks for offering to work on this. I've now included MoE support in this PR, within the existing slot-update contract: gated/non-gated and 3D layouts, shared factors, and TP/EP-local slot views. The update path reuses the existing loading/sharding logic.

The manager suite passes 74 tests, including 40 MoE layout/cache cases and five GPU-sync regressions. A real MoE engine also passes zero/restore, eviction persistence, GPU-only updates, and direct slot writes under MRV2 with CUDA graphs. Multi-GPU serving validation is still open.

I've expanded the ZO rationale too: pin the adapter and retain its buffer views so each probe can write directly, avoiding cache transfers and reset-then-copy work. Your review of the MoE/EP cases would be welcome.

